#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When resetting a qubit, reset to 1 instead of 0 with probability "
"`p_reset`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Al reiniciar (reset) un qubit, reinicia a 1 en lugar de 0 con probabilidad "
"`p_reset`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When measuring a qubit, flip the state of the qubit with probability "
"`p_meas`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Al medir un qubit, invierte el estado del qubit con probabilidad `p_meas`.\n"

